    <p>when people love what they do &amp; do what they love, it brings a newfound purpose to their lives. they begin to live in the frequency of authenticity. this is what raises the vibration of this earth, and THAT is my mission.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-signoff">
    <p class="footer-from">from one dreamer to another,</p>
    <p class="footer-heart">&#9825;</p>
    <img src="/assets/images/initials.png" width="120" alt="Nicole Gosé signature" style="display:block; margin:8px auto;" />
    <p class="footer-name">nicole gos&eacute;</p>
    <p class="footer-sub">// Founder &amp; Creative, Dreamer Lab LLC &middot; &copy; {year}</p>
  </div>
</footer>
